{"availability":"available","full":"fabkury/servoom","name":"servoom","description":"Read the Divoom cloud and decode its pixel art: Python and C libraries, CLI, web app; read-only API maps and file-format docs.","category":"Developer tools","language":"C","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2025-11-09T12:40:00Z","updated":"2026-10-06T21:05:31Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://servoom.pages.dev/","topics":["api-client","c99","decoder","ditoo","divoom","divoom-cloud","divoom-pixoo","file-format","pixel-art","pixel-art-gallery","pixelart","pixoo","pixoo-16","pixoo-32","pixoo-64","pixoo16","pixoo64","reverse-engineering","times-gate"],"demo":"https://servoom.pages.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.630Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.630Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.630Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.630Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["servoom.pages.dev/download, the web app: log in with your Divoom account, browse the gallery by category or by user, and save any artwork as WebP, GIF or the original file, straight from the browser. servoom.pages.dev/stats, community statistics: uploads, likes, views, curation and canvas sizes of the Divoom gallery, refreshed every four hours. The data comes from servoom-stats. Pixoo64-Advanced-Tools by tidyhf, a desktop application for the Pixoo 64 built with servoom: browse the cloud library with its likes and comments, and much more, on Windows.","Divoom's pixel-art devices (Pixoo, Ditoo, Times Gate, ...) share a community gallery whose artworks are stored in undocumented binary containers and served by an undocumented API. servoom maps that API, read-only, and decodes every container seen in the wild into standard images. It ships as a Python library and CLI, a C99 library and CLI with byte-identical output, and a browser app."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fabkury/servoom/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"695f03e11f2411a39905d9d2c186e675a8c67251773db4714952d1f91727f1d7","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.770Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.770Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"servoom.pages.dev/download, the web app: log in with your Divoom account, browse the gallery by category or by user, and save any artwork as WebP, GIF or the original file, straight from the browser. servoom.pages.dev/stats, community statistics: uploads, likes, views, curation and canvas sizes of the Divoom gallery, refreshed every four hours. The data comes from servoom-stats. Pixoo64-Advanced-Tools by tidyhf, a desktop application for the Pixoo 64 built with servoom: browse the cloud library with its likes and comments, and much more, on Windows.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fabkury/servoom/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> servoom.pages.dev/download, the web app: log in > with your Divoom account, browse the gallery by category or by user, and save any artwork > as WebP, GIF or the original file, straight from the browser. > > servoom.pages.dev/stats, community statistics: > uploads, likes, views, curation and canvas sizes of the Divoom gallery, refreshed every > four hours.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fabkury/servoom/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Most of it works without an account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fabkury/servoom/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"695f03e11f2411a39905d9d2c186e675a8c67251773db4714952d1f91727f1d7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fabkury/servoom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.770Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T21:05:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fabkury/servoom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:48:27.771Z","hash":"695f03e11f2411a39905d9d2c186e675a8c67251773db4714952